r  messages  needs to be archived in the commission  archive to be requested  under regulation 1049 2001.  so ms o'reilly said in her response to  fraction  the german organization that the  regulation and transparency  uh is is regardless of the form of uh  in which a message was is being sent but  the commission replied to me in another  on another inquiry that currently there  is no technical framework to even save  sms messages or whatsapp messages  in internal communication so my question  would be will the commission  react to the ombudsman and start  archiving sms and whatsapp messages at  other messenger messages  um i don't i'm not sure that we are able  to answer that question here  on the podium so we will come back to  you alexander  bilaterally on this what i can say is  that  indeed what is important is the content  of a conversation not the medium  through which this conversation is being  held this is what the regulation  says and therefore the rules that are  uh that are supposed to be uh that are  supposed to be applied if something is  considered like  a phone conversation with no no specific  contact exchange then than not if there  is specific policy related content then  it should be  uh then it should be archived whether  it's then technically feasible or not we  will have to come back to you  on whether we are doing something on it  or not  okay i give the floor to christian  christian pardo who's the only one with  his hand raised  christian we say  [Music]  security  follow  [Music]  uh  [Music]  okay i now open the floor to other  subjects and i give the  floor to berkeley  yeah hi um here from politico i just got  a quick question to see if there's a  reaction  from the u.s treasury's investigations  into digital services taxes  specifically in spain and italy thank  you  thank you um i'm not sure whether it is  for miriam or  for  at this stage  yes i can repeat what i said yesterday  we still have not  received any notification from the us  authority so we cannot comment further  at this stage  true you had answered the question  yesterday apologies for that  thank you any other questions for us  today  that does not seem to be the case so  thank you very much and  see you tomorrow

